# Architecture — Dependency Rule

This project uses feature-based layers under `src/`:

- `src/features/<feature>/components/` — UI only
- `src/features/<feature>/hooks/` — UI state / orchestration
- `src/features/<feature>/services/` — data access (API, storage)
- Shared: `src/components/`, `src/hooks/`, `src/lib/`, `src/stores/`, `src/app/`

## Dependency Rule (must follow)

```
components (UI) → hooks → services
```

- **components** must NOT import from `services/` (or call fetch/axios directly).
- **hooks** may import `services/`; must NOT import pages/routes as business deps.
- **services** must NOT import components, hooks, or UI libraries for rendering.

Imports use the `@/` alias (maps to `src/`). Prefer Plop generators for new features/components.

When editing files matching `src/**/*`, preserve this direction of dependencies.
